  "version": "V26",
  "title": "Cosmological Background Evolution, Conditional Separate-Branch Screening Hypothesis (rho_Lambda = -5.96e-27 kg/m^3), Scale-Dependent G_eff(a,k), CMB Acoustic Scales, and ISW Effect at L = 10 km, alpha_Y = 1",
